{"t":"Overlord's Ashes","s":"overlord-s-ashes-a4a8d","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Overlord_s_Ashes_f0bda4.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Overlord's Ashes</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Overlord's Ashes\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Overlord_s_Ashes_f0bda4.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"corpseof\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Corpse of</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lord%20of%20the%20Elements\">Lord of the Elements</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Skin-able</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"product\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Creature Product</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Neutral%20Matter\">Neutral Matter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"liquid\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Liquid Product</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See Also: Corpses <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see   overlord's ashes.<div class=\"p-flavortext\">Use an obsidian knife on it to get neutral matter.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-corpse-text\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Overlord's Ashes1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Overlord_s_Ashes1_1a94a3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">First Stage</span><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Decay Time</b>:</span></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">5 minutes.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Weight:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be carried</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Volume:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be opened</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Overlord's Ashes2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Overlord_s_Ashes2_920835.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">Second Stage</span><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Decay Time</b>:</span></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">5 minutes.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Weight:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be carried</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Volume:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be opened</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><hr/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Overlord's Ashes3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Overlord_s_Ashes3_b66fc6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><span style=\"font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">Third Stage</span><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><b>Decay Time</b>:</span></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">60 seconds.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Weight:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be carried</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\"><b>Volume:</b></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Cannot be opened</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-corpse-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It can only be opened within <b>10 seconds after its death</b>. After that time period, the corpse is no longer a container and the items left inside are <b>lost</b>. Only the first corpse stage has the flavortext.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["elemental-spheres-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"elemental-spheres-quest","quest":"Elemental Spheres Quest","step":"3-3","n":15,"title":"Matar o Lord of the Elements","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}